\"hazard\":\"H2\",\"instruction_en\":\"Do not build yet. Tape an A4 sheet upright on the lower door frame next to the threshold and take a new photo, and measure the threshold height by hand.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"先不要施工。請在門檻旁的下門框直立貼上一張A4紙後重新拍照，並用尺手量門檻高度。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_bbf92f28-9a41-48c5-82be-9556ec7d0e2a","call_id":"call_bbf92f28-9a41-48c5-82be-9556ec7d0e2a","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H3\",\"instruction_en\":\"Secure the edge of the red rug against the wall in the walkthrough, or remove the rug from the area.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道牆邊紅色地毯的邊緣固定貼平，或將地毯移走收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_6606f004-f67f-4f08-8a20-057baf7d9286","call_id":"call_6606f004-f67f-4f08-8a20-057baf7d9286","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H4\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the black cable off the walkway and doorway threshold in the walkthrough and place it along the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道門檻上的黑色電線移離走道，沿牆邊整理收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_ce26c396-afbe-40e7-b484-ed6a668db107","call_id":"call_ce26c396-afbe-40e7-b484-ed6a668db107","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H5\",\"instruction_en\":\"Pick up the cable with plug from the hallway tiled floor and store it away from the walkway.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走廊磁磚地上的插頭電線拿起收好，離開走道。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_75f9fdd5-ef58-4ee5-a0df-924e70ed351d","call_id":"call_75f9fdd5-ef58-4ee5-a0df-924e70ed351d","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H6\",\"instruction_en\":\"Pick up the white sneakers from the tiled floor in the walkthrough and place them in a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道磁磚地上的白色布鞋拿起，放到鞋櫃裡。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_968c5a77-558e-4552-9828-fbd0dc8807af","call_id":"call_968c5a77-558e-4552-9828-fbd0dc8807af","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H7\",\"instruction_en\":\"Pick up the light-colored shoes from the wood floor in the walkthrough and place them in a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道木地板上的淺色鞋子拿起，放到鞋櫃裡。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_1eb928bd-e505-4a43-806e-523bcfe12e1e","call_id":"call_1eb928bd-e505-4a43-806e-523bcfe12e1e","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H8\",\"instruction_en\":\"Pick up the dark blue slippers from the tiled floor in the walkthrough and place them in a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道磁磚地上的深藍色拖鞋拿起，放到鞋櫃裡。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_10f83884-ff4c-43d1-b2d9-accdb03948df","call_id":"call_10f83884-ff4c-43d1-b2d9-accdb03948df","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H9\",\"instruction_en\":\"Pick up the dark blue slide slippers from the tiled floor in the walkthrough and place them in a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道磁磚地上的深藍色拖鞋拿起，放到鞋櫃裡。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_1edac63a-3b82-4c4a-b794-5f9a5eea1e08","call_id":"call_1edac63a-3b82-4c4a-b794-5f9a5eea1e08","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H10\",\"instruction_en\":\"Install a fixed grab bar on the wall next to the toilet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請在馬桶旁的牆面上安裝固定式扶手。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"FA22\"}","status":"completed"}]